# Phase 2b live-predict bundle exception: the trained per-lead Bayesian
# posteriors are needed by the predict-bayesian.yml workflow at inference
# time. ~10 MB per lead (3 leads = ~30 MB total) — fine to track directly
# until the bundle grows enough to warrant LFS or an R2-side artefact store.
!reports/phase4_artefacts/bayesian_predictions/posteriors/*.nc
# Phase 5 (lead-as-feature) posterior — single NetCDF; same need as
# Phase 4's posteriors above (predict-bayesian.yml reads it at every
# cron tick).
!reports/phase5_artefacts/posteriors/*.nc
